---
import Base from "~/layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "~/data/site";
---
<Base
  title="You're on Autopilot — what happens next"
  description="Your subscription is live. Four questions and we can start, plus exactly what happens in the first week."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="section head">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <p class="label">Subscription active</p>
      <h1>You're on Autopilot.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Payment went through and your receipt is on its way. There are four things we cannot
        work out by looking at your site, so they are below. It takes about two minutes, and
        nothing starts until you have answered them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <p class="mono n">Today</p>
        <h2>You answer four questions</h2>
        <p class="muted">Below. The rest we work out from your site and your Google figures.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="mono n">Within 2 working days</p>
        <h2>We take a full copy of your site</h2>
        <p class="muted">
          Exactly as it is now, kept for as long as you are a client. If you ever want the
          original back, you ask and we put it there.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="mono n">Week one</p>
        <h2>The visible fixes land first</h2>
        <p class="muted">
          Speed, broken links, error pages, and whether AI assistants can read you. All
          measurable within days, all checkable by you without taking our word for it.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="mono n">Every week after</p>
        <h2>One email, 90 seconds to read</h2>
        <p class="muted">
          What changed, what it did, and anything waiting for your approval. There is no
          dashboard to log into and nothing to remember.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <div class="card form-card">
        <p class="label">Four questions</p>
        <h2>Things we cannot work out by looking</h2>
        <form
          name="onboarding"
          method="POST"
          data-netlify="true"
          netlify-honeypot="company-fax"
          action="/onboarding-received/"
          class="stack"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="onboarding" />
          <p class="hp"><label>Leave empty <input name="company-fax" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></p>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="site">1. Your website address</label>
            <input id="site" name="site" type="url" required placeholder="https://" autocomplete="url" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="locked">2. Which pages must never be touched?</label>
            <p class="hint">Pricing, legal, anything you have fought over. One per line. Leave blank if none.</p>
            <textarea id="locked" name="locked" rows="3" placeholder="/pricing/&#10;/terms/"></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="approver">3. Who approves wording changes?</label>
            <p class="hint">Name and email. This is who we send proposed copy to.</p>
            <input id="approver" name="approver" type="text" required placeholder="Name — email@example.com" />
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="voice">4. Anything you would never say?</label>
            <p class="hint">Words, claims or tone to avoid. This is the single most useful answer here.</p>
            <textarea id="voice" name="voice" rows="3" placeholder="Never call us cheap. Never promise rankings."></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <label for="urgent">If something breaks, who do we call? <span class="muted">(optional)</span></label>
            <input id="urgent" name="urgent" type="text" placeholder="Phone or email" />
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Send and get started</button>
          <p class="mono muted small">
            You can change any of this later by replying to any email we send.
            See the <a href="/legal/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.
          </p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section closing">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose">
      <h2>A few things worth knowing</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Cancelling.</strong> Any time, from the link in your receipt. Everything we
        improved stays yours, or you can ask for your original site back instead.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Stopping us mid-flight.</strong> Reply to any email with the word stop and all
        automatic activity halts immediately. It does not wait for anyone to be at their desk.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>What we will never change.</strong> Your prices, your guarantees, your legal
        wording, or the settings that control whether Google shows your site.
        <a href="/what-it-changes/">The full list is public</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Questions before we start? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .head { padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .head h1 { margin-block: 1rem 1.2rem; }
  .steps { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
  @media (min-width: 720px) { .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2rem; } }
  .steps h2 { font-size: var(--step-1); margin-block: 0.35rem 0.5rem; }
  .steps p.muted { font-size: var(--step--1); }
  .steps .n { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; }
  .form-card h2 { font-size: var(--step-2); margin-block: 0.6rem 1.6rem; }
  form { --flow: 1.4rem; }
  .field { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  label { font-size: var(--step--1); font-weight: 600; }
  .hint { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0; }
  input, textarea {
    font: inherit; font-size: 16px; padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); width: 100%;
  }
  textarea { resize: vertical; }
  input:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible { border-color: var(--focus); }
  button { width: 100%; justify-content: center; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .small { font-size: 0.7rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .small a { color: var(--accent); }
  .hp { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }
  .closing h2 { font-size: var(--step-2); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .closing p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .closing a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
